Package: ARCSDOCVH
Title: ZIP-Level Cardiovascular-Related SDOH Clusters
Version: 0.0.1
Authors@R: c(
    person("Scott", "Zuo", email = "scott.zuo@northwestern.edu", role = c("aut", "cre")),
    person("Lucia", "Petito", email = "lucia.petito@northwestern.edu", role = "aut")
  )
Description: Provides ZIP-level cardiovascular-related social determinants of health
    cluster assignments derived from ZIP/ZCTA-level contextual variables. The
    package includes the final K-means cluster assignment dataset, a data dictionary,
    a pre-generated map, and helper functions for labeling and mapping the clusters.
